&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Your Impact at LILA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We&#39;re seeking extraordinarily talented Forward Deployed Engineers to join our growing team. Our FDEs are high-performing generalists with a broad set of skills across scientific domains and software engineering, in addition to depth in one or more focus areas. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As an FDE, you&#39;ll embed directly within our internal and external customer facing biotech and science teams, living their problems and rapidly ideating, building, and deploying &amp;nbsp;solutions that transform their capabilities across the Lila platform. You&#39;ll leverage our AI and software platform tools while developing custom features that address each customer&#39;s unique challenges. This isn&#39;t traditional software development—it&#39;s high-velocity, AI-fueled, high-impact engineering where you&#39;ll ship production code in days, not months.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Building&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Developing, wrapping, and adapting domain-specific tools for molecular modeling, data analysis, process optimization, and more.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploying custom agentic scientific workflows that integrate with industrial instruments (PLCs, control software) and data systems (ERP, MES, SCADA).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building real-time data pipelines that transform scientific data into actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creating intuitive interfaces that make complex AI/ML capabilities accessible to scientists.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Succeed&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Background in biology, molecular science, or related scientific field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to communicate effectively with external partners and internal product and technical leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with data engineering, ETL pipelines, and working with complex datasets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong full-stack development skills with the ability to work across backend, frontend, and data layers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional problem-solving abilities and comfort with ambiguous requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knack for product discovery and an ability to pass well-defined customer requirements back to the product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel to customer sites for engineering &amp;nbsp;deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
